# === Data (code-only per the GENIE BPC data-use agreement) ================
# Never commit patient-level or controlled-access data. The folder STRUCTURE is
# tracked via .gitkeep + data/README.md; every real data file is ignored.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/README.md
**/retrieved_genie_data/
**/retrieved_tcga_data/
**/msk_retrieved_data/
**/extracted_variables_*
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.maf
*.parquet
*.gz

